description: Angular wrapper rules for packages/components-angular
globs: packages/components-angular/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# PDS Angular

- Preserve the Angular wrapper API around existing PDS web components instead of re-implementing behavior.
- Follow `PorscheDesignSystemModule.load()` setup patterns for NgModule or standalone bootstrap flows.
- Pass extra ARIA through the wrapper's `[aria]` input instead of adding `aria-*` directly to the host.
- Avoid manual edits to generated `dist/` output unless the task is explicitly about published artifacts.
- Validate wrapper changes with `yarn test:unit:components-angular`.
